~ title

Animal Attack

=> END


~ start

#%Walking on through some fields,
#|	% you notice some dark shapes around you, moving in sync with your pacing. [wait=1] A pack of wild wolves have surrounded you!
#Walking on through some fields,
#	% you notice a large hulking shape, moving towards you from the distance. [wait=1] Its a grizzly bear!

Walking on through some fields, you notice some dark shapes around you, moving in sync with your pacing.
	[wait=1][br] A pack of wild wolves have surrounded you!
	[wait=1][br][br] What will you do?

- Run away
	You attempt to run away from the [[wild|rabid|hostile]] [[animals|creatures|beasts]].
	%
		You escape from the hungry [[animals|creatures|beasts]].
	%
		They catch up to you and attack you.
		% => fight_failure
		% => fight_success

#- Lure away with food - sacrifice 1 ration.
#	%2 => fight_failure
#	%1 => fight_success
#- Lure away with food - sacrifice 2 rations.
#	%1 => fight_failure
#	%3.5 => fight_success

- Fight
	You attempt to fight the [[wild|rabid|hostile]] [[animals|creatures|beasts]].
	% => fight_success
	% => fight_failure

=> END


~ fight_success
do Game.player.apply_stat(Character.StatType.HEALTH, -10.0)
do Game.player.apply_stat(Character.StatType.HUNGER, -5.0)
do Game.inventory.add( Items.FOOD, 2 )
You sucessfully defeat them albeit not without injury.
	[wait=1][br]2x Food obtained
=> END

~ fight_failure
do Game.player.apply_stat(Character.StatType.HUNGER, -5.0)
You sucessfully defeat them without injury.
=> END

